  "plan": {
    "schemaVersion": "2.0",
    "metadata": {
      "name": "Chart Champions BTC playbook v3",
      "assetClass": "CRYPTO",
      "timeframe": "30m",
      "createdBy": "IMPORTED",
      "description": "Chart Champions style BTC plan on 30-minute bars, tuned on real 2025 BTC data and checked unchanged on 2026. CC Fibonacci: a pullback into the 0.618-0.66 zone with the 4-hour 26/55 EMA trend and at least two more confluences; stop 0.3% beyond the 0.786 level, half off at 1R, the rest at 3R, then breakeven. 4-hour EMA swing: the 26 EMA crosses the 55 EMA on the side of the 200 EMA, with a trailing stop. Both may hold a position at once; 1% risk each, 2.5% open risk at most. Left out after testing: swing failure patterns, failed auctions and CCV value rotation, which lost money in every tested period as mechanical rules."
    },
